@host = http://localhost:5080
@keyboard = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@mouse = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. List products  <-- PRZEWIDŹ WYNIK ZANIM WYŚLESZ
GET {{host}}/products

### 1b. List products, explicit paging
GET {{host}}/products?page=1&pageSize=2

### 2. Reserve 2 keyboards (OnHand 5)
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{keyboard}}",
  "quantity": 2,
  "customerEmail": "ania@example.com"
}

### 3. Check the product after the reservation
GET {{host}}/products/{{keyboard}}

### 4. Reserve the only limited-edition mouse
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{mouse}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerEmail": "bartek@example.com"
}

### 5. Try to reserve the mouse again -> expect 409
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{mouse}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerEmail": "celina@example.com"
}

### 6. Blocked customer -> expect 403
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{keyboard}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "customerEmail": "oszust@fraud.example"
}

### 7. Get a reservation (paste the id from the response above)
GET {{host}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Confirm a reservation (paste the id)
POST {{host}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm

### 9. Cancel a reservation (paste the id)
POST {{host}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### 10. Force an expiry sweep now (instead of waiting for the worker tick)
POST {{host}}/admin/sweep
